---
---

<section id="gobierno" class="py-28 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left side: Value proposition -->
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-lime-400 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-lime-400 rounded-full"></span>
          Conformidad & Estándares Internacionales
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
          Gobernanza TI que resiste cualquier auditoría.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Muchas empresas sufren observaciones de auditoría por falta de controles SoD o procesos desordenados de cambios. En NEXUS TI formalizamos la operativa sin restar agilidad a los equipos de desarrollo.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl glass-panel-relay border border-white/[0.08]">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-lime-400/10 text-lime-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">01</div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Segregación de Funciones (COBIT / SoD)</div>
              <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Auditoría sistemática de matrices de incompatibilidad en ERPs (SAP, Oracle) y bases de datos.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl glass-panel-relay border border-white/[0.08]">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-400/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">02</div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Mesa de Servicio & ITIL 4 Service Desk</div>
              <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Catálogo de servicios formal, monitoreo de incidentes y resolución bajo rigurosos acuerdos SLA.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl glass-panel-relay border border-white/[0.08]">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-lime-400/10 text-lime-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">03</div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Comité de Control de Cambios (CAB)</div>
              <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Pases a producción controlados, planes de reversión probados y trazabilidad completa.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right side: Compliance radar card with Relay luxury glass -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="glass-panel-relay rounded-3xl p-8 border border-white/[0.12] relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-white/[0.08] mb-6">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-lime-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Matriz de Madurez TI</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">Nivel 4 / Optimizado</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono mb-2">
                <span class="text-white">Alineamiento COBIT 2019 (EDM / APO / BAI)</span>
                <span class="text-lime-400 font-bold">96%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-lime-400 rounded-full" style="width: 96%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono mb-2">
                <span class="text-white">Madurez ITIL 4 (Incident, Problem & Change)</span>
                <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">94%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-cyan-400 rounded-full" style="width: 94%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono mb-2">
                <span class="text-white">Controles SoD & Seguridad ISO 27001</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">98%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-emerald-400 rounded-full" style="width: 98%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono mb-2">
                <span class="text-white">Resolución de Incidentes en Primer Contacto</span>
                <span class="text-lime-400 font-bold">88%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-lime-400 rounded-full" style="width: 88%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-xl bg-lime-950/20 border border-lime-400/25 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
            <span class="text-lime-400 font-bold">Evaluación Inicial:</span> Diagnosticamos perfiles y accesos con riesgos SoD en 5 días hábiles.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
